## **Advantages of Recursion**  
✅ **Simplifies Complex Problems:** Makes code cleaner and easier to understand.  
✅ **Natural for Problems Like:** Tree traversal, factorial, Fibonacci series, etc.  

## **Disadvantages of Recursion**  
❌ **Memory Usage:** Each call adds to the call stack, which can lead to **StackOverflowError**.  
❌ **Slower:** Due to the overhead of multiple function calls. Iterative solutions can be faster.  

---

## **Recursion vs Iteration**  
| **Aspect** | **Recursion** | **Iteration** |  
|------------|---------------|---------------|  
| **Memory** | More (call stack) | Less |  
| **Speed** | Slower | Faster |  
| **Code Readability** | Often cleaner | Sometimes lengthy |  
| **Use Case** | When problem has a recursive nature | Simple loops |  

